Arrow or Nameless function :
           
          it us used when we write a single line of code.
     Syntax :
         let variable_name = (parameters...) => condition or code ;
     Example :
           // arrow or nameless function
           let oddEven = (a) => a%2 == 0 ? "even": "odd";
            console.log(oddEven(123))
